; db6_data_readout_inject_debug pulse-injection waveform
; 14 bit words: bits[13:2] = signed 12 bit offset from the runtime pedestal
; (t_debug_control_data_readout_inject.pedestal), bits[1:0] tied 0 to match
; real adc data's own "(13 downto 2)" format (see db6_gbt_encoder_adc_data.vhd).
; 222 pulses, 6 samples each (5 rise/fall + 1 undershoot), starting at address
; 16, repeating every 16 addresses, amplitude growing linearly
; from 100 to 2000 across the 222 repeats. All other addresses are 0
; (== exactly at pedestal, no offset).
memory_initialization_radix=16;
